SUMMARY:FCR featuring Carolyn Dutton
DESCRIPTION:Featuring the timeless hits of Crosby\, Stills\, Nash & Young\, Bob Dylan\, The Beatles\, and More! \nFCR is a musical collaboration between Frank Jones\, Rick Clayton\, and Chuck Wills\, reinterpreting songs from your favorite classic artists. With tight 3-part harmonies\, these multi-instrumentalists often include cello\, upright bass\, and slide guitar in their shows. Carolyn Dutton joins them on violin for what will be a memorable musical journey. \nBUY TICKETS
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/fcr-featuring-carolyn-dutton-2026/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Blues,Clasic Rock,Country,Featured Event,Fingerstyle,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-FCR_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Brown County Playhouse
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261127T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261127T160000
DTSTAMP:20260820T203100Z
CREATED:20260820T201450Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260820T203100Z
UID:10001516-1795788000-1795795200@browncountyplayhouse.org
SUMMARY:The Amazing Dennis Experience
DESCRIPTION:Experience an unforgettable afternoon of laugh-out-loud comedy\, astonishing sleight-of-hand\, and impossible magic happening right before your eyes! \nThe Amazing Dennis Experience blends world-class magic\, hilarious storytelling\, and plenty of audience participation into a fast-paced show the whole family can enjoy. \nAnd for the grand finale… The Amazing Dennis will do the impossible and magically make Santa Claus appear on center stage!\nThis is one holiday magic show your family won’t soon forget. Get your tickets today! \n \nBUY TICKETS
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/the-amazing-dennis-experience-2026/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Christmas,Comedy,Featured Event,Magic
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2026-DennisMagic_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Brown County Playhouse
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261127T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261127T213000
DTSTAMP:20260820T121538Z
CREATED:20260820T115552Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260820T121538Z
UID:10001515-1795807800-1795815000@browncountyplayhouse.org
SUMMARY:Jingle Bell Rockin' Tribute Band
DESCRIPTION:A Tribute to Bobby Helms and His Christmas Classic “Jingle Bell Rock” with Special Guest: The Isaac Family Band. \nWhen country music singer Bobby Helms was first offered the chance to sing a new festive song called “Jingle Bell Rock\,” he was initially skeptical about the idea of mixing rock’n’roll and Christmas. But he was quickly won over\, and his single\, issued by Decca Records in October 1957\, soon became a holiday classic. “‘Jingle Bell Rock’ has made itself a part of Christmas\,” Helms said. “It lifts people up.” Today\, you can find it on playlists alongside staples like “Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer\,” Nat King Cole’s “The Christmas Song\,” \n\nBUY TICKETS
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/jingle-bell-rockin-tribute-band-2026/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Blues,Clasic Rock,Featured Event,Music,Pop Rock
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2026-jinglebell_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
